# Chat module

- Controllers own `@Res()`, abort-on-disconnect, and UI message streaming — not agents.
- Persist via `ConversationStore` keyed by `(userId, conversationId)` only.
- Swap stores in `ChatModule` (`CONVERSATION_STORE`); do not change agents when swapping persistence.
- Document stream endpoints in Swagger but note Try-it-out limits (`docs/lessons/03-swagger-openapi.md`).
- DTOs: `class-validator` + `@ApiProperty` / `@ApiPropertyOptional`.
